WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:02.068
-We are in the Doom Box.

00:00:02.068 --> 00:00:05.304
Our next three songs will decide
tonight's champions.

00:00:05.304 --> 00:00:08.174
It's time for
"Slay It, Don't Spray It."

00:00:08.174 --> 00:00:09.542
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:09.542 --> 00:00:13.412
-♪ I don't know, but I don't
wanna get sprayed ♪

00:00:13.412 --> 00:00:14.781
-Here's how this works --

00:00:14.781 --> 00:00:17.149
On your turn, you're gonna have
to sing a well-known song

00:00:17.149 --> 00:00:18.484 line:0%
karaoke-style.

00:00:18.484 --> 00:00:20.086 line:0%
You'll have the lyrics
in front of you,

00:00:20.086 --> 00:00:21.320 line:0%
but when the music drops out,

00:00:21.320 --> 00:00:23.156 line:0%
you have to finish the line
from memory.

00:00:23.156 --> 00:00:25.325 line:0%
If you don't get the lyrics
exactly right,

00:00:25.325 --> 00:00:28.228
those microphones will spray you
and your partner in the face.

00:00:28.228 --> 00:00:29.695
[ Laughter ]

00:00:29.695 --> 00:00:31.764
Uh, but if you can slay it and
sing all the words perfectly,

00:00:31.764 --> 00:00:34.367
then your opponents
get drenched instead.

00:00:34.367 --> 00:00:37.070
Each song is worth
50,000 points.

00:00:37.070 --> 00:00:39.405
Jabari, Quavo,
your team is up first.

00:00:39.405 --> 00:00:41.240
-Let's go, then.
-Let's see what song you get.

00:00:41.240 --> 00:00:43.276 line:0%
-Let's do it.
[ Computer beeping ]

00:00:47.113 --> 00:00:49.415 line:0%
-"Rapper's Delight,"
Sugarhill Gang!

00:00:49.415 --> 00:00:50.683 line:0%
-I'm good with this one.
-All right, good.

00:00:50.683 --> 00:00:51.784 line:0%
-Yeah, I got this one, then.

00:00:51.784 --> 00:00:52.785 line:0%
