-I'll do the next one.

00:00:56.455 --> 00:00:57.623 line:0%
-You're Quavo, though!

00:00:57.623 --> 00:00:59.525 line:0%
-But I'll do the next one.
-All right, bud.

00:00:59.525 --> 00:01:01.361 line:0%
